HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0001.fits, spectra0002.fits,          HISTORY spectra0003.fits, spectra0004.fits, spectra0005.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0006.fits, spectra0007.fits, spectra0008.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0009.fits, spectra0010.fits, spectra0011.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0012.fits were combined using a robust weighted mean             HISTORY with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The             HISTORY scale factors were determined using order 1 and are:                    HISTORY 0.85567286588543, 1.0076780386223727, 0.8347857759800266,               HISTORY 0.9413785727899269, 0.96084308919478, 0.9142846586789641,               HISTORY 0.9924380827628396, 1.017979227321209, 1.0744816946456563,              HISTORY 1.2410102698764143, 1.2175336217063282, 1.1814560373208949.             END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             